{"id":"n61099-1-11","stage":1,"title":"마을 · 村子","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61099-1-11-1","ko":"여기가 내가 어린 시절을 보낸 곳이야.","zh":"这里就是我度过童年时光的地方啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기가","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기가","audio":"/audio/3ee44a24dbb231646aee.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"어린","meaning":"年幼、年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年幼、年龄小；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어린","audio":"/audio/f78bf8d27dff1667b0ba.mp3"}},{"text":"시절을","meaning":"时期","explanation":"시절：时期；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시절","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65302","senseId":"1","lemma":"시절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시절을","audio":"/audio/ea99fffec4761e0f06fd.mp3"}},{"text":"보낸","meaning":"度过","explanation":"보내다：度过；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"7","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보낸","audio":"/audio/246415f22c4e6f2a2bfb.mp3"}},{"text":"곳이야.","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳이야","audio":"/audio/6ee54b14a8048b2ca9d7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年幼、年龄小","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8","term":"시절","zh":"时期","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3","entryId":"65302","definition":"特定的时期或时间。","pronunciation":["시절"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"让时间流逝。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]}],"audio":"/audio/b00f97483a8afc01d538.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61099-1-11-2","ko":"조용하고 아름다운 시골 마을에서 자랐구나.","zh":"原来你是在一个安静又美丽的乡村长大的啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조용하고","meaning":"安静","explanation":"조용하다：安静；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"조용하다","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58167","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조용하고","audio":"/audio/6a107015e2616b2f3b33.mp3"}},{"text":"아름다운","meaning":"美丽，漂亮","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름다운","audio":"/audio/fcd5ba4c8c0304b5a6f1.mp3"}},{"text":"시골","meaning":"乡下，农村，乡村","explanation":"시골：乡下，农村，乡村","readings":[{"term":"시골","audio":"/audio/8d3efc29ac663a719491.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62488","senseId":"1","lemma":"시골","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시골","audio":"/audio/8d3efc29ac663a719491.mp3"}},{"text":"마을에서","meaning":"村子，村庄","explanation":"마을：村子，村庄；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61099","senseId":"1","lemma":"마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마을에서","audio":"/audio/2abe17db6f2ad95d732d.mp3"}},{"text":"자랐구나.","meaning":"生长，成长","explanation":"자라다：生长，成长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"자라다","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66317","senseId":"2","lemma":"자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자랐구나","audio":"/audio/0411402ecd55e8eefb62.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1cd9dc985df28c49","term":"조용하다","zh":"安静","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3","entryId":"58167","definition":"听不见任何声音。","pronunciation":["조용하다"]},{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽，漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"对象、嗓音或颜色等令眼睛和耳朵都感到愉快和满足。","pronunciation":["아름답따"]},{"id":"8d3efc29ac663a71","term":"시골","zh":"乡下，农村，乡村","audio":"/audio/8d3efc29ac663a719491.mp3","entryId":"62488","definition":"离城市较远、人口稀少且开发不充分的地区。","pronunciation":["시골"]},{"id":"16a6e53889b32d5b","term":"마을","zh":"村子，村庄","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3","entryId":"61099","definition":"多户人家聚集生活的地方。","pronunciation":["마을"]},{"id":"17c36cbe99642c8e","term":"자라다","zh":"生长，成长","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3","entryId":"66317","definition":"在某种环境过背景下长大。","pronunciation":["자라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c4667df6428f674e5734.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.487,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61099